  "title": "2026-07-25-eval-160035 · eval-harness-orchestration",
  "description": "# Offline evaluation harness orchestration\nA left-to-right, top-to-bottom flow showing how a pinned, fingerprinted scenario suite is executed by a bounded worker pool against an isolated system-under-test instance; how infrastructure faults remain distinct from product regressions; how independent evidence-backed graders operate concurrently; and how valid verdicts become a scorecard that is compared only with a fingerprint-compatible baseline. All artifacts, transcripts, and verdicts are retained, and a promoted compatible run becomes a future baseline.",
  "mode": "diagram",
